{"id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-gap-sentence.md","title":"悬浮句子/真值空缺句子","display":"df-gap-sentence — 悬浮句子/真值空缺句子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-gap-sentence","aliases":["91-df-gap-sentence","91-df-gappy-sentence"],"display":"df-gap-sentence — 悬浮句子/真值空缺句子","depends_on":["[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-liar-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-gap-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-gap-sentence</span><span>91-df-gappy-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gap-sentence — 悬浮句子/真值空缺句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-gap-sentence-—-悬浮句子-$\\mathrm{Gap}$\">df-gap-sentence — 悬浮句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> (极小固定点的真句编码集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span> (相应固定点模型, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{X_{\\min}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(v_{X_{\\min}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span> (固定点诱导的强 Kleene 评估)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span>：极小固定点中的悬浮句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span>：被判真的句子编码集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 被判假</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：悬浮句子是指在极小固定点模型中既不为真也不为假的句子。其特征如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>真值空缺</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与其否定的编码都不在真理外延中</li>\n<li><strong>悖论相关</strong>：典型悬浮句子包括说谎者句子及其变体</li>\n<li><strong>部分逻辑特征</strong>：悬浮句子体现了部分逻辑的&quot;第三值&quot;（未定义）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>悬浮句子的例子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>说谎者句子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>诚实者句子</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)\">\\(\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)\\)</span>（在极小固定点中也悬浮）</li>\n<li><strong>说谎者循环</strong>：多句子构成的悖论循环</li>\n</ul>\n<p>悬浮与理论的联系：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>悬浮句子处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>预期固定点模型含悬浮句子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>经典对象理论不直接给出上述三值外延</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>只对基础语言给出析取式公理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>可用超赋值式预期语义解释悬浮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>悬浮句子是理解部分真理理论的关键概念，它们展示了为何需要非经典逻辑来处理自指真理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-gap-sentence-—-悬浮句子-$\\mathrm{Gap}$","text":"df-gap-sentence — 悬浮句子 $\\mathrm{Gap}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\min}$ (极小固定点的真句编码集, see [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}$ (相应固定点模型, see [[91-df-fixed-point-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}","display":false},{"tex":"v_{X_{\\min}}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\}\n=\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\mid\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\varphi\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{X_{\\min}}\\not\\vDash_3\\neg\\varphi\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":2482,"backlinks":[{"id":"965681a90864b053","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n